  <History Date="21-09-23" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (very poor documentation.  charts only.  vague.  many ranges incomplete and don't make sense.  24 channels doesn't agree with the specs on the manufacturer's website.  Channels 1-5 are just labelled 'Color 1-5'.  Assumed these are actually RGBAL but no way to be sure)" Version="0" />
  <History Date="22-09-23" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." Version="1" />
